<title>HUNGARY: Richter to buy 25,000 of own shares.</title>
<headline>Richter to buy 25,000 of own shares.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian pharmaceuticals company Richter said on Friday that it had authorised a brokerage to buy 25,000 Richter shares on its behalf.</p>
<p>Richter commissioned the brokerage to buy the shares on the stock exchange, the brokerage said in a statement in the Budapest Stock Exchange's (BSE) official gazette. The statement did not disclose the timing of the transaction.</p>
<p>Richter closed at 8,350 forint, unchanged, on the BSE on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
